<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were stronger at the open Monday following-through on Friday's rally, but a weak bond market was likely to be a drag on equities.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up 15 at 7016 and the Nasdaq Composite was up fractionally at 1312.</p>
</text>
